            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's new

- **Run While Awake.** Keep a command running while Keep Awake is on — for example a tunnel to reach your Mac from your phone with the lid closed. It starts when Keep Awake turns on, stops when it turns off, and restarts if it exits on its own. Caffy remembers your last 5 commands so you can switch between them from the menu. See the README for setup and security tips.

---

## 新功能

- **防休眠期间运行。** 防休眠开启期间让一条命令保持运行，比如合盖后从手机远程连回 Mac 用的隧道。开启防休眠时启动，关闭时停止，意外退出会自动重启。Caffy 会记住最近 5 条命令，可在菜单中切换。设置方法和安全提示见 README。
]]></description>
