            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's new

- **Automatic updates.** Caffy now checks for new versions once a day. Use **Check for Updates…** in the menu to check at any time, or turn off **Automatically Check for Updates**.

---

## 新功能

- **自动更新。** Caffy 每天检查一次新版本。可随时点菜单中的「检查更新…」手动检查，也可以关闭「自动检查更新」。
]]></description>
